<section class="section section--cream connection">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2 class="connection__title">
      Creating deeper, more immersive connections with nature.
    </h2>

    <div class="connection__grid">
      <p>
        Connecting with nature helps build a better world, and deep listening is a powerful place to start. We need communities that listen to one another and to their environment to become more resilient and live in harmony with the planet.
      </p>
      <p>
        Deeper connections with nature foster conservation and restoration through listening and sound. Listening to a place is one of the most honest ways to respect and protect it, while sharpening our auditory awareness is one of the most profound ways to truly connect with anything and anyone.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="connection__image">
    <img
      src="/images/connection-river.jpg"
      alt="Person walking along a river in the rainforest, listening to the environment"
      loading="lazy"
    />
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .connection__title {
    font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 5.5vw, 3.25rem);
    max-width: 24ch;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .connection__grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: clamp(1.5rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    color: var(--color-ink-soft);
    margin-bottom: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .connection__image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: clamp(18rem, 40vw, 30rem);
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius);
  }

  @media (max-width: 780px) {
    .connection__grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>